 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's top 5 non-EU import partners in 2005 were China, the United States, Switzerland, the United Kingdom, and Malaysia.",
  "Total imports in 2005 reached 5.40 billion euros, with the top 3 partners accounting for 61.1% of imports.",
  "China was the largest non-EU import partner with 2.25 billion euros, representing 41.7% of total imports.",
  "The United States was the second largest partner with 572.4 million euros, followed by Switzerland with 474.6 million euros.",
  "About 5.3% of imports came from undisclosed partners, which are included in totals but not ranked by country."
